      "writtenOn": "2022-02-04T11:08:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the approach could work, but did you consider not adding the excluded libraries in the first place? E.g. store the list of excluded libraries in CLC (or should it be CLCM?) and check it before adding a new library. It could spare all the hassle on reconstructing and copying, and passing the list of excluded libs around.",
      "parentUuid": "7007c970_adca08ca",
      "revId": "9bbbfa8c70f1254f6bdb989839c6fbaf2129b052",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
