      "message": "\u003e unfortunately, that is a map (rather than a structure holding a map)\n\nIt can be changed to a struct, but that might require refactoring in many places where these maps are created, and the nil-map handling would also change.\n\n\u003e I would have to place the logic in every place where additional entries can be added\n\nI tried to reduce it to two places: `addContext` and `AddContextMap`.\n\n\u003e I would still have to deal with an existing CLCM that is provided by another library\n\nAh, this I didn\u0027t think of. Good point.\n\nNow that we agree on the current approach, let me know when the CL is ready for detailed review.",
